concept:c2023c00239-sch-1-sec-5 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "5 After subsection 12BL(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-5 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  Schedule 1  Unfair contract terms in insurance contracts  Financial Sector Reform (Hayne Royal Commission Response—Protecting Consumers (2019 Measures)) Act 2020  Compilation date: 15/09/2023 Registered: 21/09/2023  (1A) This Subdivision does not apply to a contract of insurance:  (a) under which a person provides medical indemnity cover (within the meaning of the Medical Indemnity (Prudential Supervision and Product Standards) Act 2003) for:  (i) a medical practitioner (within the meaning of that Act); or  (ii) a registered health professional (within the meaning of that Act) prescribed by regulations made under that Act for the purposes of a provision of Part 3 of that Act; and  (b) to which that Act applies." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  Schedule 1  Unfair contract terms in insurance contracts  Financial Sector Reform (Hayne Royal Commission Response—Protecting Consumers (2019 Measures)) Act 2020  Compilation date: 15/09/2023 Registered: 21/09/2023  (1A) This Subdivision does not apply to a contract of insurance:  (a) under which a person provides medical indemnity cover (within the meaning of the Medical Indemnity (Prudential Supervision and Product Standards) Act 2003) for:  (i) a medical practitioner (within the meaning of that Act); or  (ii) a registered health professional (within the meaning of that Act) prescribed by regulations made under that Act for the purposes of a provision of Part 3 of that Act; and  (b) to which that Act applies."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "f54cc850935c25229137d376b96754159270fc7be6199d9a9cc23d6498469b28" ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exempts certain medical indemnity contracts from the Subdivision's application." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <c2023c00239.pdf> ;
    dc:source "c2023c00239.pdf, p.7" ;
