    values:originalText "Insert:  Schedule 1  Unfair contract terms in insurance contracts  Financial Sector Reform (Hayne Royal Commission Response—Protecting Consumers (2019 Measures)) Act 2020  Compilation date: 15/09/2023 Registered: 21/09/2023  (1A) This Subdivision does not apply to a contract of insurance:  (a) under which a person provides medical indemnity cover (within the meaning of the Medical Indemnity (Prudential Supervision and Product Standards) Act 2003) for:  (i) a medical practitioner (within the meaning of that Act); or  (ii) a registered health professional (within the meaning of that Act) prescribed by regulations made under that Act for the purposes of a provision of Part 3 of that Act; and  (b) to which that Act applies." ;
    cof:pageNumber "7"^^xsd:integer .

