    values:originalText "(1) The amendments of this Act made by Schedule 1 to the Financial Sector Reform (Hayne Royal Commission Response—Protecting Consumers (2019 Measures)) Act 2020 apply in relation to a contract entered into on or after the commencement of that Schedule.  Unfair contract terms in insurance contracts  Schedule 1  Financial Sector Reform (Hayne Royal Commission Response—Protecting Consumers (2019 Measures)) Act 2020 Compilation date: 15/09/2023 Registered: 21/09/2023" ;
