concept:c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-15c a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "15C Meaning of mortgage intermediary"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-15c ;
    values:originalText "(1) A licensee is a mortgage intermediary if:  (a) the licensee carries on a business of acting as an intermediary in relation to credit contracts secured by mortgages over residential property; and  (b) the licensee does not perform the obligations, or exercise the rights, of a credit provider in relation to the majority of those credit contracts; and  (c) in carrying on the business, the licensee acts as an intermediary in relation to credit contracts offered by more than one credit provider.  (2) A credit representative of a licensee is a mortgage intermediary if:  Schedule 3  Mortgage brokers" ;
    skos:definition "(1) A licensee is a mortgage intermediary if:  (a) the licensee carries on a business of acting as an intermediary in relation to credit contracts secured by mortgages over residential property; and  (b) the licensee does not perform the obligations, or exercise the rights, of a credit provider in relation to the majority of those credit contracts; and  (c) in carrying on the business, the licensee acts as an intermediary in relation to credit contracts offered by more than one credit provider.  (2) A credit representative of a licensee is a mortgage intermediary if:  Schedule 3  Mortgage brokers"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c3f420bebe8187427f672b429826aa8789fcf891f859782c986af9b44f2da1a4" ;
