concept:c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-158l a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "158L Application of this Subdivision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-158l ;
    values:originalText "(1) This Subdivision applies in relation to credit assistance provided by a licensee to a consumer in relation to a credit contract if the licensee is a mortgage broker.  (2) However, this Subdivision does not apply in relation to credit assistance provided to a consumer in relation to a credit contract by a credit representative acting within the scope of the credit representative’s actual or apparent authority from the licensee. Note 1: A credit representative in these circumstances is covered by Subdivision B of this Division. Note 2: The conduct of any other representative, acting within the scope of actual or apparent authority from the licensee, is taken to have been engaged in also by the licensee: see sections 324 and 325." ;
    skos:definition "(1) This Subdivision applies in relation to credit assistance provided by a licensee to a consumer in relation to a credit contract if the licensee is a mortgage broker.  (2) However, this Subdivision does not apply in relation to credit assistance provided to a consumer in relation to a credit contract by a credit representative acting within the scope of the credit representative’s actual or apparent authority from the licensee. Note 1: A credit representative in these circumstances is covered by Subdivision B of this Division. Note 2: The conduct of any other representative, acting within the scope of actual or apparent authority from the licensee, is taken to have been engaged in also by the licensee: see sections 324 and 325."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "0b57bf61c87a4b54aefef6aec64c1ca213a50cfcfba922fb818b3eaea8c1019c" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-158l-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-158l-ss-2 ;
