concept:c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-158l-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "158L(2) Application of this Subdivision"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-158l-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) However, this Subdivision does not apply in relation to credit assistance provided to a consumer in relation to a credit contract by a credit representative acting within the scope of the credit representative’s actual or apparent authority from the licensee. Note 1: A credit representative in these circumstances is covered by Subdivision B of this Division. Note 2: The conduct of any other representative, acting within the scope of actual or apparent authority from the licensee, is taken to have been engaged in also by the licensee: see sections 324 and 325." ;
    skos:definition "(2) However, this Subdivision does not apply in relation to credit assistance provided to a consumer in relation to a credit contract by a credit representative acting within the scope of the credit representative’s actual or apparent authority from the licensee. Note 1: A credit representative in these circumstances is covered by Subdivision B of this Division. Note 2: The conduct of any other representative, acting within the scope of actual or apparent authority from the licensee, is taken to have been engaged in also by the licensee: see sections 324 and 325."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "fd88b1a8452a7f831ddbb64b79588c91bb16766866a5c554b87689a043194c26" ;
    values:partOf concept:c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-158l ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Exemption from application of this subdivision for credit assistance provided by a credit representative acting within their actual or apparent authority." ;
