concept:c2023c00239-sch-3-sec-158lb a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "158LB Conflict between consumer’s interests and those of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-3-sec-158lb ;
    values:originalText "licensee etc.  If the licensee knows, or reasonably ought to know, that there is a conflict between the interests of the consumer and the interests of:  (a) the licensee; or  (b) an associate of the licensee; or  (c) a representative of the licensee; or  (d) an associate of a representative of the licensee;  Mortgage brokers  Schedule 3 Main amendments  Part 1  Financial Sector Reform (Hayne Royal Commission Response—Protecting Consumers (2019 Measures)) Act 2020 Compilation date: 15/09/2023 Registered: 21/09/2023  the licensee must give priority to the consumer’s interests when providing the credit assistance. Civil penalty: 5,000 penalty units. Subdivision B—Credit representatives that provide credit assistance in relation to credit contracts" ;
    skos:definition "licensee etc.  If the licensee knows, or reasonably ought to know, that there is a conflict between the interests of the consumer and the interests of:  (a) the licensee; or  (b) an associate of the licensee; or  (c) a representative of the licensee; or  (d) an associate of a representative of the licensee;  Mortgage brokers  Schedule 3 Main amendments  Part 1  Financial Sector Reform (Hayne Royal Commission Response—Protecting Consumers (2019 Measures)) Act 2020 Compilation date: 15/09/2023 Registered: 21/09/2023  the licensee must give priority to the consumer’s interests when providing the credit assistance. Civil penalty: 5,000 penalty units. Subdivision B—Credit representatives that provide credit assistance in relation to credit contracts"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "ed0e67111aa799d03199905779ca5dc26f39f8d86bd5385d387bda3b94cd6db1" ;
    cof:pageNumber "16"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Licensee must give priority to consumer's interests when providing credit assistance." ;
    dc:description "Yes" ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
